## Acknowledgments

`agy-pulse` draws inspiration and design references from:
- [`icebear0828/agy-hud`](https://github.com/icebear0828/agy-hud) — Antigravity CLI multi-line statusline HUD & cloud quota tracking concepts
- [`zzusec/agy-statusline`](https://github.com/zzusec/agy-statusline) — Real-time context window, Protobuf compaction ceiling decoding, and cost monitor concepts
- [`elviscjn-cjn/antigravity-context-viewer`](https://github.com/elviscjn-cjn/antigravity-context-viewer) — `gen_metadata` Protobuf `timeToFirstToken` / `streamingDuration` decoding and per-model performance telemetry concepts
